WEBVTT

00:02:29.596 --> 00:02:33.156
I worried about not only Walter,

00:02:33.196 --> 00:02:35.436
but I worried about what
do other people think?

00:02:35.476 --> 00:02:38.436
Does everyone see me
and think I got this huge role

00:02:38.476 --> 00:02:40.796
because I'm a twofer,
because I check two boxes,

00:02:40.796 --> 00:02:43.276
that it's not because of how good
I am at what I do,

00:02:43.316 --> 00:02:45.196
but because of what I represent.

00:02:45.196 --> 00:02:47.956
You know, I've now come to learn
I can't worry about that.

00:02:47.996 --> 00:02:51.396
But at the time, it really
weighed on me quite a bit.

00:02:51.396 --> 00:02:53.316
I left that job a few years ago.

00:02:53.316 --> 00:02:54.716
It took me almost three years

00:02:54.756 --> 00:02:56.956
between knowing
I wanted to leave and leaving.

00:02:56.996 --> 00:03:01.116
And it took me three years
because I felt such responsibility